    "show_share": true,
    "description": "There's bad news and good news in a recent survey of 1,854 rural and urban Kenyan youth. The bad news: Far too many are willing to be corrupt in order to be wealthy. And the good news: Those same youth have cherished values and beliefs that may indicate a willingness to change their minds and ultimately turn the tide of corruption in the next generation.",
